    "hint_texts": "Modify the _make_test_folds method in the StratifiedKFold class to use the check_random_state function. Replace 'rng = self.random_state' with 'rng = check_random_state(self.random_state)' to ensure the random state is correctly validated and applied. This change will guarantee that using different random_state values produces the expected shuffling behavior.",
